{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ZNovxGizyW1793197563.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國股市走勢反覆，投資者觀望美國聯儲局貨幣政策會議結果。</p><p></p><p>道指低開後反覆回升。早段曾升逾100點，迫近52,500點前有阻力。上日升逾300點的納指繼續向好，早段再升約100點。</p><p></p><p>科技股普遍上升，晶片股美光科技和閃迪曾升約半成。SK海力士ADR預託證券，早段升一成。美國富商馬斯克旗下，太空探索公司SpaceX則跌逾百分之2。電動車生產商特斯拉亦跌百分之1。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:21:14.919704+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T14:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T05:38:13.361320+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T15:18:25.598047+00:00","content_hash":"be252a0879dae4887227eff2f0fc58ab78e295c50453e9caac2e3265bf573e8f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:21:14.919704+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}